<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <EnableDefaultCompileItems>false</EnableDefaultCompileItems>
    <AnalysisLevel>latest-all</AnalysisLevel>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- NuGet Package Metadata -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Himmelt.ModbusLib</PackageId>
    <Version>1.0.5</Version>
    <Authors>Himmelt</Authors>
    <Company>Himmelt</Company>
    <Description>一个功能完整、高性能的Modbus客户端库，支持.NET 8/9/10平台和多种Modbus协议变体。</Description>
    <Copyright>Copyright © 2024-2026 Himmelt</Copyright>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Himmelt/ModbusLib</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Himmelt/ModbusLib</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <Tags>modbus, modbus-rtu, modbus-tcp, modbus-udp, .net, dotnet, client, protocol</Tags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>False</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <Title>ModbusLib</Title>
    <PackageTags>modbus;modbus-rtu;modbus-tcp;modbus-udp;.net;dotnet;client;protocol</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>v1.0.5: 修复 Channel 传输（尤其 RTU over Channel）超时后请求/响应永久失步——超时不再清空会话通道导致残留帧被后续请求误读、且库自身无法自愈；现于发请求前排空通道、超时后清理残留，并按 设备地址/功能码/帧长 校验响应相关性，丢弃错配帧与半帧碎片；DisconnectAsync 增加会话复位语义，使重试具备自愈能力；新增可选的有界会话构造（ChannelSession(int)）以防滞留帧无上限堆积。行为变更：DisconnectAsync 由空操作改为复位会话缓冲；错配/畸形响应帧会被丢弃并等待至超时（可能表现为超时而非长度不匹配）。</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageIcon>nuget_logo.png</PackageIcon>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- 包含README.md文件到NuGet包 -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|AnyCPU'">
    <GenerateAssemblyInfo>True</GenerateAssemblyInfo>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Release|AnyCPU'">
    <GenerateAssemblyInfo>True</GenerateAssemblyInfo>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Include="**/*.cs" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="obj\**" />
    <EmbeddedResource Remove="obj\**" />
    <None Remove="obj\**" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="System.IO.Ports" Version="10.0.10" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net8.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.IO.Pipelines" Version="10.0.10" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="nuget_logo.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
